       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REVERSENUMBER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 N           PIC 9(9) VALUE 12345.
       01 REMAINING   PIC 9(9).
       01 DIGIT       PIC 9.
       01 REVERSED    PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE N TO REMAINING
           PERFORM UNTIL REMAINING = 0
               DIVIDE REMAINING BY 10
                   GIVING REMAINING REMAINDER DIGIT
               COMPUTE REVERSED = REVERSED * 10 + DIGIT
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "ORIGINAL: " N
           DISPLAY "REVERSED: " REVERSED
           STOP RUN.
